{"id":"Ce9d6a28ace4e0bce0dd9","zh":"动力相互作用","en":"dynamic interaction","domain":"轨道结构与动力学","definition_zh":"系统不同组成部分在动态作用下彼此影响的过程。","definition_en":null,"usage_note":null,"scope_note":null,"usage_overview":null,"translation_note":null,"usage_variants":[{"id":"C3c29d2e588f13a6020ef","zh":"动力相互作用","en":"dynamic interaction","domain":"列车轨道基础结构动力学","group_id":"Hffc5d300d31eb4787a7c","abbreviations":[],"context_label":"列车轨道基础结构动力学 · 徐磊（2023）"},{"id":"Ce9d6a28ace4e0bce0dd9","zh":"动力相互作用","en":"dynamic interaction","domain":"轨道结构与动力学","group_id":"Hffc5d300d31eb4787a7c","abbreviations":[],"context_label":"轨道结构与动力学 · 徐磊等（2023）"}],"designations":[{"id":"D92e4215f573b95aacdf6","language":"zh","role":"headword","text":"动力相互作用"},{"id":"D8a916d103cfefaf845b8","language":"en","role":"headword","text":"dynamic interaction"}],"sources":{"P123":{"id":"P123","title":"铁路列车−轨道−基础结构动力相互作用统一分析Part II:混凝土车致疲劳损伤与空时演化","authors":"徐磊,余志武","year":"2023","doi":"10.19713/j.cnki.43-1423/u.T20220389","journal_citation":"铁道科学与工程学报","label":"徐磊等（2023）","overview_slug":"2023-unified-analysis-for-railway-train-track-substructure-dynamic-interaction-part-ii-train-induced-conc"}},"complete_examples":[{"id":"S7a54d2a5ab25cbdac325","source_id":"P123","page":2,"page_end":2,"language":"en","text":"The fatigue damage and residual deformation of the concrete structure under the action of the previous train were taken as one of the initial conditions of the dynamic equation of the next train-track-substructure dynamic interaction, and the coupled time-varying analysis of the spatial vibration and fatigue damage evolution for this unified system was realized.","citations":[{"source_id":"P123","page":2,"page_end":2}]},{"id":"S70d1fe859431d8cd8706","source_id":"P123","page":1,"page_end":1,"language":"zh","text":"基于车辆-轨道耦合动力学基本原理,引入混凝土疲劳损伤本构和砂浆黏弹性-疲劳本构,基于已建立的列车-轨道-基础结构动力相互作用模型为基础,在铁路工程系统动力学框架内建立了列车循环作用下无砟轨道混凝土结构疲劳损伤动力演化计算模型。","citations":[{"source_id":"P123","page":1,"page_end":1}]},{"id":"S2c1cc2e855f10a974a3a","source_id":"P123","page":6,"page_end":6,"language":"zh","text":"因为荷载形式不同,本文采用车辆-轨道动力相互作用作为砂浆损伤的荷载源, 而试验采用不同应力水平(0.60,0.65,0.75和0.85) 的等幅值荷载,且显著大于一般列车荷载下砂浆所承受的应力水平,故而疲劳应变幅值要大于本文计算结果。","citations":[{"source_id":"P123","page":6,"page_end":6}]}],"related_terms":[{"id":"C30ca8725e97464966f50","target_concept_id":"C30ca8725e97464966f50","target_zh":"车辆-轨道耦合动力学","target_en":"vehicle-track coupling dynamics","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"C15fa8b9ce6cedb04f243","target_concept_id":"C15fa8b9ce6cedb04f243","target_zh":"列车-轨道-基础结构","target_en":"Train-track-substructure","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"C18e94588f31a4a2e7c33","target_concept_id":"C18e94588f31a4a2e7c33","target_zh":"混凝土疲劳损伤","target_en":"concrete fatigue damage","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"Cfb9028eaecb91cd62d7f","target_concept_id":"Cfb9028eaecb91cd62d7f","target_zh":"基础结构","target_en":"railway infrastructure","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"Cffb829c04e1247173d30","target_concept_id":"Cffb829c04e1247173d30","target_zh":"无砟轨道","target_en":"ballastless tracks","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"C30e6942e8878e224cdda","target_concept_id":"C30e6942e8878e224cdda","target_zh":"结构疲劳","target_en":"structural fatigue","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"C9424a78fd13bc783c5d2","target_concept_id":"C9424a78fd13bc783c5d2","target_zh":"动力演化","target_en":"dynamic evolution","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"C99a383e727ffd5a66700","target_concept_id":"C99a383e727ffd5a66700","target_zh":"系统动力学","target_en":"system dynamics","label":"同句术语","reason":null}],"suggested_comparisons":[],"relations":[],"collocations":[],"symbols":[],"units":[],"formulas":[],"external_references":[],"families":[],"sense_choices":[],"related_sources":[{"id":"P123","title":"铁路列车−轨道−基础结构动力相互作用统一分析Part II:混凝土车致疲劳损伤与空时演化","authors":"徐磊,余志武","year":"2023","doi":"10.19713/j.cnki.43-1423/u.T20220389","journal_citation":"铁道科学与工程学报","label":"徐磊等（2023）","overview_slug":"2023-unified-analysis-for-railway-train-track-substructure-dynam